For points moving parallel to the $Z$ axis ($\dot{X} = \dot{Y} = 0$) we get: 

$$\begin{aligned}
\begin{bmatrix}
\dot{x} \\
\dot{y}
\end{bmatrix}
= -\frac{\dot{Z}}{Z}
\begin{bmatrix}
x \\
y
\end{bmatrix}
\end{aligned}$$

